  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="16" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">Yet</char> <char style="w" strong="G1437">when</char> <char style="w" strong="G2097">I preach the gospel</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">have</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">no reason</char> <char style="w" strong="G2745">to boast</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1063">because</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char> <char style="w" strong="G318">am obligated [to preach]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1945">. . .</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1063">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3759">Woe</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">to me</char> <char style="w" strong="G1437">if</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2097">I do not preach the gospel</char>! <verse style="v" number="17" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">If</char> <char style="w" strong="G4238">my</char> <char style="w" strong="G3778">[preaching]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1635">[is] voluntary</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2192">I have</char> <char style="w" strong="G3408">a reward</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1161">But</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">if</char> <char style="w" strong="G210">[it is] not voluntary</char>, <char style="w" strong="G4100">I am [still] entrusted with</char> <char style="w" strong="G3622">[a] responsibility</char>. <verse style="v" number="18" /><char style="w" strong="G5101">What</char> <char style="w" strong="G3767">then</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">is</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">my</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3408">reward</char>? <char style="w" strong="G2443">That</char> <char style="w" strong="G2097">in preaching the gospel</char> <char style="w" strong="G5087">I may offer</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong