  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="24" /><char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1492">Do you not know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G4712">a race</char> <char style="w" strong="G3303">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">all</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G5143">runners</char> <char style="w" strong="G5143">run</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G1520">only one</char> <char style="w" strong="G2983">receives</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G1017">prize</char>? <char style="w" strong="G5143">Run</char> <char style="w" strong="G3779">in such a way</char> <char style="w" strong="G2443">as to</char> <char style="w" strong="G2638">take [the prize]</char>. <verse style="v" number="25" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">Everyone</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">who</char> <char style="w" strong="G75">competes in the games</char> <char style="w" strong="G1467">trains with strict discipline</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">. . .</char>. <char style="w" strong="G3767">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3303">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1565">They [do it]</char> <char style="w" strong="G2443">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2983">[for]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4735">a crown</char> <char style="w" strong="G5349">[that is] perishable</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">we [ do it for a crown ]</char> <char style="w" strong="G862">[that is] imperishable</char>. <verse style="v" number="26" /><char style="w" strong="G5106">Therefore</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char> <char style="w" strong="G5143">do not run</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3779">vvv</char> <char style="w" stron